# Params for the offline demo project (emulators only). Not secret.
# The real project gets its own functions/.env.<projectId> with its Hosting origin.
#
# Share links open the viewer's Vite dev server (npm --prefix code/viewer run dev),
# because that is the build of the page that talks to the emulators. Hosting on
# 127.0.0.1:5050 serves a production build, which never does, so a link there
# shows "This link can't be opened right now". A non-demo project can never use a
# local origin: createSession refuses it (functions/src/viewerOrigin.ts), and
# tests/src/contract.test.ts checks every functions/.env.* file.
VIEWER_ORIGIN=http://localhost:5173
